        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: शिकायत",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "शिकायत — śikāyat — \"a complaint\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पुलिस क्या करेगी, यह आपकी शिकायत पर निर्भर करता है। pulis kyā karegī, yah āpkī śikāyat par nirbhar kartā hai. What the police will do depends on your complaint."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "is usually traced, through Persian, to Arabic shikāya, \"a complaint\". शिकायत (śikāyat) करना is to complain; at a police station, शिकायत (śikāyat) is the formal complaint."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for telling what happened."
            }
          ]
        },
