              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "रिपोर्ट — riporṭ — \"a report (to the police)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मीरा ने थाने जाकर चोरी की रिपोर्ट की। Mīrā ne thāne jākar corī kī riporṭ kī. Mira went to the police station and reported the theft."
            },
