          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "रिपोर्ट (riporṭ) is borrowed from English report, taken into Hindi as a feminine noun: चोरी की रिपोर्ट, the report of a theft, and रिपोर्ट करना, to report it."
            }
          ]
