          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "लिखवाना — likhvānā — \"to have written down\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "अरुण ने पुलिस से अपनी शिकायत लिखवाई। Aruṇ ne pulis se apnī śikāyat likhvāī. Arun had the police write down his complaint."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with ने (he or she …): उसने रिपोर्ट लिखवाई, usne riporṭ likhvāī."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "लिखवाना (likhvānā) is the second causative of लिखना, to write, which goes back to Sanskrit likhati, \"scratches, writes\" (CDIAL 11048). The ending -vā- hands the work to someone else: शिकायत (śikāyat) लिखवाई, got the complaint written down."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
