              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "हवालात — havālāt — \"a lock-up\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पुलिस ने चोर को रात भर हवालात में रखा। pulis ne cor ko rāt bhar havālāt meṁ rakhā. The police kept the thief in the lock-up all night."
            },
